<h2>Asobi 1.0 (build 1011)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>The notes column's width handle</b> (and the note field's height grip) now follow the mouse exactly &#8212; they were jumpy, chasing the edge they were moving.</li>
<li>The cheat sheets fit their page again: the reviewer sheet had run under the key legend.</li>
</ul>
